  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When meta methyl aniline reacts with sodium nitrite in presence of an acidic medium then&nbsp;diazonium&nbsp;salt is formed then on reaction with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math>-naphthol a colored compound is formed.</p><p>Meta methyl aniline also undergoes for the halogentaion reaction and desired compound is formed.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f4745c16-3beb-4502-a4d3-2c965b2a812d.jpeg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 209px;\" /></p>",
